  "description": "Shunya Labs (Shunya Research Labs Pvt Ltd) is an Indian voice-AI company with offices in Gurugram and a US office in Wilmington, Delaware. It sells Horizon speech-to-text (Indic, Universal, Code-Switch and Medical models), Radiance text-to-speech and the Resonance voice-agent platform through a pay-as-you-go API, with self-hosted and on-device deployment on Enterprise. Its focus is Indian languages and code-switched speech; the Horizon Universal model is published as gated open weights (pingala-v1-universal).",
